  m_Name: Spider4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Question
  questionText: What do you think of the East District development?
  largeQuestionBox: 1
  conversation:
  - "Well on paper it\u2019s good, but so\u2019s half the stuff Bunyon promises,
    and that\u2019s where most of it stays."
  - "We still don\u2019t have a physician, but you know what we have <i>two of</i>
    now?"
  - Squash courts.
  - "And I don\u2019t mean he expanded the one court into <i>two</i>. We now have
    <i>two</i> separate squash courts, owned by <i>two</i> separate people."
  - "What I <i>really don\u2019t</i> care for is what it\u2019s all doing to the
    sky, because of the... <i>what do you call it...</i>"
  - "<color=notiCol>Light pollution, that\u2019s it. It\u2019s ruining the view at
    night.</color> Which is a shame, since that\u2019s when I\u2019m the most busy."
  - "The one <i>good</i> thing he\u2019s done with it all is the Youth Housing."
  - "Eddie, that punk teenager you might\u2019ve seen running around, <color=notiCol>I
    looked out for him when he was on the street. He and I are tight.</color>"
  - "<color=notiCol>So after the mayor set him up there</color>, that put me at ease
    a little. So there\u2019s that at least."
  unlocked: 1
  newQuestion: 1
